OL,3,GNEWSAVillage fears losing Archers link
OL,4,Aif show moves
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitors travel from as far as New
OL,7,FZealand to a Worcestershire village
OL,8,Fsaid to have inspired BBC Radio 4's The
OL,9,FArchers, but residents fear their link
OL,10,Fto the long-running radio drama could
OL,11,Fsoon be weakened.
OL,13,FThe concerns follow the BBC's decision
OL,14,Fto shelve plans for a purpose-built
OL,15,Fstudio in Birmingham, raising the
OL,16,Fprospect of the programme being
OL,17,Frecorded outside the West Midlands for
OL,18,Fthe first time in it's 75-year history.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
