OL,3,GNEWSAVillage fears losing Archers link
OL,4,Aif show moves
OL,5,
OL,6,FInkberrow is believed to have inspired
OL,7,Fthe show's fictional village of
OL,8,FAmbridge, while The Old Bull Inn is
OL,9,Fclosely associated with the show's pub,
OL,10,FThe Bull.
OL,12,FLandlord, Joe Reed, said it would be
OL,13,F"quite sad" if The Archers was moved
OL,14,Faway from the region.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
